            "review_title": "Review at Kogane",
            "review_text": "Oscaryankee\n22 contributions\n0\nHidden gem in Little Tokyo (Le Thanh Ton St.) area of Saigon\nOct 2019\nThis modest looking place serves first class japanese sashimi, sushi as well as other traditional japanese dishes - high quality at reasonable prices. So, if you are tired to grossly overprices 'designer' sushi places and just want a superb meal at a fair price, Kogane is definitely worth a visit!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 24, 2019",
